yFIGHT MONSTER COMMAND:

o    HIT 'F' TO ATTACK THE MONSTER
YOU ARE FACING. TO ATTACK ANOTHER
MONSTER, TURN AND FACE IT. WHILE
YOU CAN ATTACK ONLY ONE MONSTER AT
A TIME, UP TO FOUR MONSTERS CAN
ATTACK YOU AT ONCE, SO BE CAREFUL.

r    YOUR ATTACK WILL BE MADE WITH
YOUR CURRENT WEAPON. TO CHANGE
WEAPONS HIT 'W' FOR THE WEAPONS
SELECTION MENU. WEAPONS CAN BE
OBTAINED EITHER BY DEFEATING ENEMY
MONSTERS, OR THEY CAN BE PURCHASED
AT A STORE IN THE TOWN.
g    THE SUCCESS OF YOUR ATTACK IS
DETERMINED BY THE FOLLOWING
FACTORS: YOUR STRENGTH, YOUR LEVEL,
YOUR WEAPON AND VARIOUS MAGICAL
FACTORS, INCLUDING SPELLS LIKE
ENCHANT WEAPON AND STRENGTH. ALSO,
THE POWER WEAPON SPELLS CAN GREATLY
IMPROVE YOUR ATTACKS (TEMPORARILY).
b    YOUR ATTACKS WILL ALSO BE
AFFECTED BY THE ENEMY MONSTER'S
LEVEL, STRENGTH, ARMOR AND AGILITY.

yHIT ANY KEY TO CONTINUE...
ex
yFIGHT MONSTER COMMAND:   (PAGE 2)

n    THE TIME IT TAKES TO COMPLETE
YOUR ATTACK WILL DETERMINE HOW MANY
ATTACKS YOU GET. SMALL WEAPONS
STRIKE FASTER THAN LARGE ONES, BUT
THEY ALSO DO FAR LESS DAMAGE.
MAGICAL POWER WEAPONS GET FAST
ATTACKS AND DO A LOT OF DAMAGE.
YOUR STRENGTH INCREASES YOUR
ABILITY TO HIT AND THE DAMAGE YOU
DO.

r    SPECIAL NOTE: IF YOU HOLD
DOWN THE CONTROL KEY AND HIT 'F'
(CTRL-F), YOU CAN FIGHT TO THE
DEATH WITHOUT HAVING TO KEEP
HITTING THE 'F' KEY. OR POINT TO
'FIGHT' AND PRESS THE RIGHT MOUSE
BUTTON. FIGHTING STOPS IF YOU HIT
ANOTHER KEY.

yHIT ANY KEY...
